<h4 style="text-align: center;">Additional Resources</h4>
<div class="container">
<div class="row greyBoxes">
<div class="greyBoxes-box u-textCenter">
<h6 class="greyBoxes-title" style="text-align: center;"><i class="icon icon-magnifying-glass"></i>For a Full List of Resources in Your Area, Dial 211</h6>
<p style="text-align: center;">2-1-1 Is a 24/7 community assistance hotline designed to provide information and referral services to health, human, and social service organizations. Get help paying bills, finding food, and locating other resources in your area.</p>
<p class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center" style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.211.org/" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Learn More Here</a></p>
<br><br><br></div>
</div>
<div class="row greyBoxes">
<div class="greyBoxes-box">
<h6 class="greyBoxes-title" style="text-align: center;"><i class="icon icon-bread"></i>Find a "Mini-Pantry" Near You</h6>
<p style="text-align: center;">There are dozens of food pantries in Northwest Arkansas. Simply type in your zip code, city, state, or region to see mini-pantries in your area.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="http://mapping.littlefreepantry.org/" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Find a Pantry</a></p>
